    "body":  "The decision to spawn the robot facing the left was made such that the teams solutions autonomously reorient it until they identify the shelves using computer vision. For phase 1 judging we will use the same files that were provided so yes, it will be oriented to the left. As for the testing sessions and the competition, it is safe to assume that it will not be pointing directly at the shelves so keep your solution versatile to all case scenarios (oriented to the left, right, or backwards)",
